{"id":2131,"level":79,"name":"Пішаковий ендшпіль (1)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>If the board becomes empty, this does not always mean that the complexity decreases. Even endgames with only kings and pawns can be incredibly complicated. There is even a kind of unwritten rule among grandmasters that they simply do not play pawn endgames: they are too complicated!</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Of course, this does not apply to all pawn endgames. There are certain principles that are incredibly useful to learn, such as opposition.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Moreover, calculation skills are extremely important in pawn endgames. It is critical to calculate all options for both sides so that you ensure that your pawn reaches the other side first.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Calculate accurately by making sure that your pawn arrives at the other side first.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"6k1/5p2/8/2P3p1/p2K2Pp/P4P2/8/8 b - - 0 47","pgn":"47... Kf8 48. c6 Ke7 49. c7 Kd7 * ","text":"<p>Чорні мають захищений пасовий пішак на h4. Зараз головним чином справа в тому, що чорні перешкоджають просуванню білих. Після цього ендшпіль легко виграє.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/4k1pp/2p1p3/8/3KPP2/PpP2P2/7P/8 w - - 0 36","pgn":"36. Kd3 c5 37. c4 * ","text":"<p>Це складніше. Важливо, щоб білі зупиняли чорного пішака. Крім того, білі також хочуть, щоб пішак чорного шахів не міг переміститися на поле c4, щоб захистити пішака b3.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/3k4/1K6/8/8/P7/8/8 w - - 0 55","pgn":"{[%evp 0,7,1022,1022,24588,29970,29973,29974,29977,29978]} 55. Kb7 {[%csl Gb7,Yc6,Yc7,Yc8,Rd7]} Kd6 56. a4 Kc5 57. a5 Kb5 58. a6 {[%csl Ga6]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78344,"fen":"8/p7/1p6/5K2/2P5/1P6/Pk6/8 w - - 0 64","pgn":"{[%csl Gb3,Gc4][%evp 0,5,719,910,992,1012,1032,29952]